Drop a photo named after its article's slug in here, e.g. 2026-08-13.jpg
(matching content/articles/2026-08-13.mdx), and it becomes that issue's
card and hero image automatically — no frontmatter edit needed. Supported
extensions: .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .webp. To use a different filename or share
one image across issues, set `image: "/images/articles/whatever.jpg"` in
the article's frontmatter instead.
